le=\"white-space:nowrap\">56 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Gold\"><img alt=\"Gold\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Icon_f66d4c.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span></td></tr><tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Rope\"><img alt=\"Rope\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Rope_6119aa.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></td><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Rope\">Rope</a></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">50 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Gold\"><img alt=\"Gold\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Icon_f66d4c.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span></td></tr><tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Short%20Sword\"><img alt=\"Short Sword\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Short_Sword_5f153d.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></td><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Short%20Sword\">Short Sword</a></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">30 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Gold\"><img alt=\"Gold\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Icon_f66d4c.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span></td></tr><tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Simple Arrow\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Simple_Arrow_bdffa5.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></td><td>Simple Arrow</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">2 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Gold\"><img alt=\"Gold\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Icon_f66d4c.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span></td></tr><tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Spear\"><img alt=\"Spear\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Spear_5c898c.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></td><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Spear\">Spear</a></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">10 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Gold\"><img alt=\"Gold\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Icon_f66d4c.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span></td></tr><tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/White%20Mushroom\"><img alt=\"White Mushroom\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/White_Mushroom_c1cb03.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></td><td><a href=\"#/wiki/White%20Mushroom\">White Mushroom</a></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">6 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Gold\"><img alt=\"Gold\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Icon_f66d4c.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-transcripts\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Transcripts\">Transcripts</span></h3>\n<dl><dd><i>To change these transcripts, edit the transcripts page for Avriel.</i></dd></dl>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\nPlayer: hi <br/>\nAvriel: Welcome to my little shop, &lt;player&gt;! Are you looking to <b>trade</b> anything precious? <br/>\nPlayer: <b>bye</b> <br/>\nAvriel: See you around, adventurer. <br/>\nPlayer: <b>time</b> <br/>\nAvriel: It is &lt;<b>time</b>&gt;. <br/>\nPlayer: <b>shop / goods / equipment / potions</b> <br/>\nAvriel: I am selling all kinds of equipment. Let me know if you're interested in a <b>trade</b>. <br/>\nPlayer: <b>trade</b> <br/>\nAvriel: Of course, take a look and see what might interest you. <br/>\nPlayer: <b>name</b> <br/>\nAvriel: <b>Avriel</b> is the <b>name</b>, I take care of all goods, gear and supplies. Though I'm also a great at chest, ah nevermind.... <br/>\nPlayer: <b>Avriel</b> <br/>\nAvriel: Yes, that's me. <br/>\nPlayer: <b>job</b> <br/>\nAvriel: I'm the shop owner here, if you're interested ask me for a <b>trade</b>. <br/>\nPlayer: <b>quest / mission</b> <br/>\nAvriel: Quest? Oh no, I can't help you with that. But maybe <b>Viola</b> or <b>Gustavo</b> could use some help. <br/>\nPlayer: <b>king</b> <br/>\nAvriel: Our <b>King</b> Tibianus rules over everything. <br/>\nPlayer: <b>Thais</b> <br/>\nAvriel: You should visit <b>Thais</b> someday, it's our capital with lots of shops, trainers and great people. <br/>\nPlayer: <b>Newhaven / island</b> <br/>\nAvriel: Ever since I moved here, life has just been great, if only those goblins wouldn't terrorise us. Maybe you could help us, talk to <b>Gustavo</b> for more information. <br/>\nPlayer: <b>Gustavo</b> <br/>\nAvriel: Ah, my good friend <b>Gustavo</b>, he's keeping us safe from the north part of this island. I heard he's talking about needing some assistance, if you're interested don't be shy to talk to him. <br/>\nPlayer: <b>Viola</b> <br/>\nAvriel: <b>Viola</b> always wins on our quiz nights, one can really learn much from her. I guess if your interested in learning more, she's the right person to talk to. <br/>\nPlayer: <b>Flavius</b> <br/>\nAvriel: <b>Flavius</b> is running the bank here in Newhaven. <br/>\nPlayer: <b>Anna</b> <br/>\nAvriel: <b>Anna</b> often travels to the <b>mainland</b> to get supplies for my shop, it's great working with her. You can find her at the ferry house just north of here. <br/>\nPlayer: <b>Tim</b> <br/>\nAvriel: If you ever need someone to handle the ugly things, he's your <b>guard</b> to do it. <br/>\nPlayer: <b>guard</b> <br/>\nAvriel: Oh yes, our <b>Gustavo</b> is the <b>guard</b> here in Newhaven. I heard he could use some help with the <b>muglex</b> problem, though. <br/>\nPlayer: <b>muglex</b> <br/>\nAvriel: These little creatures have been terrorising our village for quite some <b>time</b> now, I just hope we stay safe here. <br/>\nPlayer: mines<br/>\nAvriel: Legends say that a tragic accident buried a group of miners alive. Since then their souls have been roaming these tunnels, willing to find their next victim. So please be careful there!<br/>\nAvriel: Expect you want to hear the <b>news</b> about the most recent event in the mines.<br/>\nPlayer: news<br/>\nAvriel: Haven't you heard?! Everyone is talking about the explosion at the mines that revealed another part of the mines.<br/>\nAvriel: I'm not sure if they are telling the truth - it might all be just a well placed joke ...<br/>\nPlayer: helmet<br/>\nAvriel: How can that be?!<br/>\nAvriel: You found it there?!<br/>\nAvriel: I respect your willingness and openness to adventures N<br/>\nAvriel: I assure you nothing will get me close to that mine ever again.<br/>\nAvriel: Though I can't help you with that item, maybe someone here knows more about it, if not Thais and its surroundings always have plenty to offer - even in that regard.<br/>\nPlayer: <b>mainland</b> <br/>\nAvriel: I once lived on the <b>mainland</b> a long <b>time</b> ago, I was working at a shop in Yalahar, but they had to close it due to some monster problems. <br/>\n</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Avriel</strong></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>","quests":[],"pos":{"x":32554,"y":32506,"z":7}}